(sixdof-ballistic-trace)
*title Named rigid-body ballistic coefficient trace
*sixdof
*method rk4-fixed
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84
*file sixdof_ballistic_trace.dat time alt vel range gamgd psigd wt

*trajectory 1 rigid_body_vehicle start on 1
  *initial ecic x=20925646 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=300 zdt=0 time=0 mass=100
  *print time alt vel gamgd psigd p q r alpha beta dynprs
  *segment 1 rigid-body-coast
    *mass xcg=0 ixx=10 iyy=11 izz=12
    *aero sref=5.241 lrefx=2.58333 lrefy=2.58333
    *aero cx=0.12 cybeta=-0.02 cyr=0.01 czalpha=0.04 czq=-0.03 cl=0.01 clp=-0.02 cm=0.03 cmalpha=-0.04 cmq=-0.01 cnbeta=0.02 cnr=-0.03
    *when time>2 stop
*end
